==Strategy==
This stage is fairly simple, as everything spawns on a timer along with a massive cash boost at the beginning. Lure the initial threats close to the base, kill them for said cash boost, and then rush the rest of the stage down. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] works great for the initial seals and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]]/[[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] will deal with the Othom. It's fine if you get stuck fighting the other Othoms along with their support in the process of rushing down the base, as with proper meatshielding and offense nothing here should be an issue.

